      <title>Shrinkwrap 0.12.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>A file that is still arriving from Dropbox is no longer read halfway through. Shrinkwrap now waits until a source is genuinely complete — bytes local, size settled, and the last byte actually readable — before touching it.</p>]]></description>
